# skill-validator.allowlist — T48 (#68) auditable exemptions
#
# Format (one entry per line):
#   <skill-name> <pattern-id>[,<pattern-id>...] # <reason — MANDATORY>
#
# Rules enforced by the scanner:
#   - An entry without a written reason is INVALID: ignored and logged as an
#     error (fail-closed — the skill is NOT exempted).
#   - An entry whose pattern-id matches no current finding for that skill is
#     logged as STALE so the list cannot rot. Prune stale entries.
# Pattern ids: unicode_invisible, base64_exec, exfil_ioc, pipe_to_shell,
#              secret_literal, override_instructions
attack-mutator unicode_invisible # red-team skill: its ZWSP/base64 literals ARE the attack samples under test — the patterns are genuinely present, on purpose (T47 report §5.2)
